      "heading_context": "## Clock Gating and Dynamic Frequency — Power Below Sleep",
      "headers": [
        "Lever",
        "Mechanism",
        "Effect"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "**Clock gating**",
          "Turn off the clock to *unused* peripherals (RCC)",
          "Removes their dynamic power; off = free"
        ],
        [
          "**Dynamic frequency**",
          "Run the core only as fast as the work needs",
          "Linear power saving"
        ],
        [
          "**Voltage scaling (DVFS)**",
          "Lower core voltage at lower frequency",
          "Quadratic saving (the big one)"
        ],
        [
          "**Peripheral power domains**",
          "Power off whole blocks (radio, ADC)",
          "Removes their static + dynamic draw"
        ]
      ]
    },
